WEBVTT

00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:52.400
When this song was composed, I'm sure no one even imagined

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:56.860
that the Aquarias would have to go into battle.

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:01.280
Then, the Abductors came through the Dimension Gates.

00:01:01.430 --> 00:01:03.510
They've destroyed our cities and taken away our people.

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:06.460
And still, we know nothing of their intentions.

00:01:06.810 --> 00:01:09.870
However, we've determined from the recent battles

00:01:09.870 --> 00:01:14.600
that they are creatures from a different
dimension with the same technology we have.

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:19.220
The two Aquarias operated by us Neo-DEAVA,

00:01:19.790 --> 00:01:25.600
operated only by the chosen daughters, the noble and lustrous Aquarion Type-F,

00:01:26.290 --> 00:01:28.730
and the boys' one, Aquarion Type-M.

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:32.170
Abductors are unfamiliar enemies.

00:01:32.170 --> 00:01:36.650
But if we, the Daughters of Heaven, work together, we—

00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:37.660
Excuse me, Miss Zessica!

00:01:37.660 --> 00:01:38.200
Yeah?

00:01:38.660 --> 00:01:43.530
You have deployed four times and
experienced a Union in an Aquaria, correct?

00:01:44.160 --> 00:01:46.540
Tell your fellow Daughters about the rapture

00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:48.890
of being chosen by the holy guardian.

00:01:50.790 --> 00:01:52.250
Oh, yeah, about that.

00:01:53.730 --> 00:01:55.630
It feels really good.

00:01:55.630 --> 00:01:57.330
Of course it does!

00:01:57.330 --> 00:02:00.960
Offering your purity to an Aquaria is pure—

00:02:00.960 --> 00:02:07.860
But I'm sure a Union with boys is so much more intense than doing it with girls!

00:02:11.650 --> 00:02:12.940
Impure thoughts!

00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:18.070
Fortunately, the Guize Stone protects the purity of the Daughters of Heaven.

00:02:18.720 --> 00:02:21.720
Impure Unions are completely impossible!

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:22.860
But—

00:02:22.860 --> 00:02:24.960
An Aquaria is a sacred cradle.

00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:29.670
It cannot permit a woman who has been sullied by a man's touch.

00:02:29.670 --> 00:02:31.130
Exactly!

00:02:40.890 --> 00:02:44.860
If a divine messenger farts...

00:02:44.860 --> 00:02:48.590
Ding, dong, ding, dong! He goes to hell!

00:02:48.590 --> 00:02:52.330
Our coffin Aquaria...

00:02:52.330 --> 00:02:56.150
It doesn't even let us sleep in dirt.

00:02:56.150 --> 00:02:57.220
But still...

00:02:57.220 --> 00:02:58.200
...we Unionize!

00:02:58.200 --> 00:02:59.270
Let's go!

00:02:59.270 --> 00:03:00.180
Union!

00:03:00.230 --> 00:03:00.950
Forceful...

00:03:00.950 --> 00:03:02.180
...Union!

00:03:02.180 --> 00:03:03.130
Do the...

00:03:03.130 --> 00:03:04.910
...Union!

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:08.580
Is that all you got, maggots?

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:10.830
You aren't fit to lick my boots.

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:13.710
Pick up the slack or I'll taze your worthless asses!

00:03:27.860 --> 00:03:31.710
Pretty rare to see you miss, Cayenne.

00:03:31.710 --> 00:03:33.220
I just slipped up.

00:03:33.220 --> 00:03:35.020
Were you having another vision?

00:03:35.490 --> 00:03:37.630
What was it this time?

00:03:37.630 --> 00:03:39.290
A wedding in funeral dress.

00:03:39.290 --> 00:03:40.280
Funeral dress?

00:03:40.930 --> 00:03:44.540
Damn it! If I had girls cheering for me,

00:03:44.540 --> 00:03:48.290
I would be much more motivated!

00:03:48.920 --> 00:03:51.410
If only the Berlin wasn't—

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:56.290
Andy! You're not thinking of sneaking to the other side again, are you?

00:03:56.740 --> 00:03:58.170
Of course not, Commander Donar!

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:02.010
You're gonna need something a little stronger than a taze.

00:04:02.730 --> 00:04:04.160
How about something like this?

00:04:05.080 --> 00:04:07.470
Ow! Ow! You're already doing it!

00:04:08.920 --> 00:04:14.980
Man, I thought I could get into Neo-DEAVA and score Unions with all the hot chicks.

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:19.270
There are so many chicks this close to me, but...

00:04:19.270 --> 00:04:22.110
I haven't even seen one yet, let alone talked to one...

00:04:22.630 --> 00:04:23.790
This... is...

00:04:23.790 --> 00:04:27.810
This is a complete disaster!

00:04:29.730 --> 00:04:31.950
Abductors detected in Crest Area.

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:35.270
All Elements report to their second-degree intercepting position.

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:37.790
They're here.

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:02.130
Vector X, departing.

00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:06.410
Vector Y, taking off.

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:10.160
Vector Z, launch.

00:06:52.880 --> 00:06:56.180
<i>Echoing through 12,000 years of time,</i>

00:06:56.180 --> 00:07:00.100
<i>the shattered pieces of soul gather here.</i>

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:06.580
<i>The legend nearing its end is about to begin.</i>

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:12.320
Genesis Union!

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:15.700
Go Aquarion!

00:07:19.090 --> 00:07:22.960
Aquarion. He knows the forbidden name...

00:07:29.340 --> 00:07:33.090
No! Stop! This Union...

00:07:38.780 --> 00:07:40.600
I'm being torn apart!

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:43.230
We'll be torn apart... and then burst!

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:47.610
Something in me is going to burst...

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:49.820
It's breaking!

00:07:56.460 --> 00:07:59.040
Aquarion EVOL!

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:03.340
Aquarion?

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:06.650
My brain is boiling over...

00:08:07.330 --> 00:08:11.340
It's pumping through my veins.

00:08:11.900 --> 00:08:13.840
Now I know what that smell was...

00:08:19.230 --> 00:08:21.480
Aquarion Evol?

00:08:21.480 --> 00:08:23.570
Aquarion, the forbidden...

00:08:23.570 --> 00:08:25.980
It's using Vector Z as the head.

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:29.110
Who knew the Aquarias had another form?

00:08:29.110 --> 00:08:31.330
It's filthy!

00:08:31.330 --> 00:08:32.930
You said impure Unions couldn't happen!

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:35.110
The seal has been broken.

00:08:35.630 --> 00:08:38.120
Thanks to those two...

00:08:38.930 --> 00:08:41.140
Amata! What's going on?

00:08:41.140 --> 00:08:43.370
Are we in an Aquaria?

00:08:44.800 --> 00:08:45.900
What does "Evol" mean?

00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:47.340
Mikono, I...

00:08:47.340 --> 00:08:48.220
I wanted to—

00:08:48.220 --> 00:08:49.750
Mikono! Is that you?

00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:51.360
Cayenne!

00:08:51.360 --> 00:08:53.090
Get away from him!

00:08:54.150 --> 00:08:55.860
Who are you?

00:08:55.860 --> 00:08:58.100
A terrorist who hijacked an Aquaria?

00:08:58.580 --> 00:08:59.310
A terrorist?

00:08:59.310 --> 00:09:00.290
You're wrong!

00:09:00.290 --> 00:09:01.830
Amata isn't—

00:09:01.830 --> 00:09:02.850
You be quiet!

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:15.730
What's going on? A couple of civilians are the head?

00:09:15.730 --> 00:09:18.200
Professor! Override the Union from headquarters!

00:09:18.520 --> 00:09:20.100
We're trying!

00:09:20.100 --> 00:09:20.700
Status?

00:09:21.390 --> 00:09:24.830
No good! It just won't respond to our commands!

00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:29.210
I've seen this before.

00:09:29.210 --> 00:09:30.670
You have?

00:09:31.260 --> 00:09:33.550
Mr. Principal! I mean, Commander!

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:35.470
What is Aquarion?

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:40.060
We purposely separated the boys from the girls into Aquaria Type-M and Type-F.

00:09:40.060 --> 00:09:42.720
But now, male and female are together as one; a complete being.

00:09:43.480 --> 00:09:48.190
But can a mortal use the weapon of a god?

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:55.010
What's the matter? Done already?

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:57.710
Come on! Get up and fight me!

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:05.650
Mikono!

00:10:06.390 --> 00:10:07.650
Abductor...

00:10:17.160 --> 00:10:17.810
What the...

00:10:35.160 --> 00:10:36.220
What was that?

00:10:36.220 --> 00:10:39.200
The manual didn't say anything about that equipment.

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:41.190
W-Wow...

00:10:41.190 --> 00:10:44.950
Who the hell is that boy? Why is he synchronizing with Aquarion?

00:10:46.340 --> 00:10:47.160
Huh?

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:49.890
Hey, you! How did you just do that?

00:10:49.890 --> 00:10:52.420
I don't know. It did that automatically.

00:10:53.230 --> 00:10:54.780
Was that an instinct?

00:10:54.780 --> 00:10:56.130
Wow. Is he a natural?

00:10:56.130 --> 00:10:58.750
You fool! No amateur could do that...

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:00.050
Here it comes!

00:11:00.870 --> 00:11:05.600
We have no choice. Since we can't override the Union, you should fight as the head.

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:08.180
Head...? Fight...?

00:11:18.610 --> 00:11:20.450
What are you doing, moron?

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:22.360
You're not helping!

00:11:27.930 --> 00:11:30.290
Stop! Please, stop!

00:11:31.030 --> 00:11:34.380
Let's get out of here! We can't fight him!

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:37.210
Let's get out! You can get us out of here, right?

00:11:37.530 --> 00:11:40.540
Hey, you! What are you talking about?!

00:11:40.540 --> 00:11:41.900
Amata! We have to escape!

00:11:41.900 --> 00:11:44.180
What can a useless pair like us do?

00:11:44.180 --> 00:11:45.390
Be quiet, Mikono!

00:11:45.980 --> 00:11:46.930
Mikono...

00:11:53.330 --> 00:11:54.700
Enemy reinforcements!

00:11:54.700 --> 00:11:56.020
They're not little ones, either.

00:11:56.020 --> 00:11:58.290
Three large units confirmed!

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:01.900
What are you doing here?

00:12:04.470 --> 00:12:07.490
Master Kagura, we have official orders.

00:12:07.490 --> 00:12:10.160
Please return to Altair with us immediately.

00:12:10.160 --> 00:12:12.370
Did that geezer Izumo send you?

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:15.540
We've already found Rare Iguras.

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:18.090
Further combat would be meaningless.

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:20.550
Combat isn't meaningless until I say it is!

00:12:26.000 --> 00:12:28.070
Damn it! What do I do?

00:12:28.070 --> 00:12:29.830
Enough sitting around!

00:12:31.180 --> 00:12:33.770
I'll show you how to fight!

00:12:35.620 --> 00:12:38.270
First, unlock the lever, like this.

00:12:52.410 --> 00:12:53.610
Whoa!

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:59.030
Zessica's Element power was channeled through the machine!

00:12:59.030 --> 00:13:01.180
Her power is resonating with the boy's!

00:13:02.200 --> 00:13:03.920
So this is a mixed Union.

00:13:04.520 --> 00:13:08.470
Commander, the Aquaria has powers we've never seen before!

00:13:08.470 --> 00:13:10.470
Forbidden powers.

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:16.270
Master Kagura!

00:13:16.270 --> 00:13:19.560
You're holding me back!

00:13:20.320 --> 00:13:21.210
What?!

00:13:21.210 --> 00:13:23.540
You're not using this, are you?

00:13:23.540 --> 00:13:24.740
Please stop already!

00:13:27.720 --> 00:13:29.160
A schism?

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:30.200
What is he doing?

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:35.260
The hell?

00:13:35.260 --> 00:13:36.290
What is he?

00:13:40.770 --> 00:13:43.670
I can smell you...

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:47.820
And I'm gonna stick my fangs into you.

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:04.110
He stole a part from another machine!

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:07.860
He's moving like an animal... or a monster!

00:14:08.320 --> 00:14:09.430
No...

00:14:10.010 --> 00:14:11.240
Mikono...

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:14.240
No... No... No!

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:16.040
What's with her?

00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:18.030
She's done nothing but whine this whole time!

00:14:18.030 --> 00:14:20.710
This is a battle! Suck it up!

00:14:23.010 --> 00:14:25.520
Mikono's just a girl.

00:14:27.100 --> 00:14:29.160
Can I even protect her?

00:14:29.590 --> 00:14:30.630
Mikono!

00:14:39.430 --> 00:14:40.690
What just happened?

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:41.800
Is that a funeral procession?

00:14:44.890 --> 00:14:46.290
The wedding in funeral dress.

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:48.360
This is the dark vision I had.

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:50.480
A wedding?

00:14:50.480 --> 00:14:53.370
That's his Element power, the prophecy of despair.

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:57.040
He foresees terrible things that
will happen to those around him.

00:14:57.040 --> 00:15:00.370
Why can we see his vision?

00:15:00.370 --> 00:15:02.320
It's Aquarion.

00:15:02.320 --> 00:15:04.870
It has reclaimed its terrible, forbidden name,

00:15:04.870 --> 00:15:06.340
and is showing us the prophecy.

00:15:06.860 --> 00:15:09.510
This is the disaster foretold in the prophecy.

00:15:10.310 --> 00:15:13.550
The terrible Union of despair!

00:15:15.960 --> 00:15:17.090
Me?
Mikono?

00:15:17.500 --> 00:15:18.980
Why me?

00:15:18.980 --> 00:15:21.520
Who is that guy? Show us your face!

00:15:27.300 --> 00:15:27.860
Who are you?

00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:40.250
Master Kagura!

00:15:43.730 --> 00:15:45.130
I know you're in there!

00:15:47.890 --> 00:15:51.070
You smelly wench!

00:15:52.380 --> 00:15:54.300
I'm going to get you!

00:15:57.660 --> 00:15:59.100
Watch out!

00:16:17.460 --> 00:16:19.540
This is your fault, kid!

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:23.080
You caused this worthless Union!

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:25.090
You dragged Mikono in with you!

00:16:25.090 --> 00:16:26.710
This entire disaster is your damn fault!

00:16:26.710 --> 00:16:27.800
You're right.

00:16:27.800 --> 00:16:29.060
It is my fault.

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:34.340
Whenever I get excited, I fly.

00:16:36.050 --> 00:16:37.750
This has happened ever since childhood.

00:16:38.280 --> 00:16:40.350
Everyone else hates me for it.

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:46.520
It even took her away from me.

00:16:47.420 --> 00:16:50.980
I never wanted to use my power again.

00:16:52.110 --> 00:16:54.950
But I wanted to protect Mikono, so...

00:16:55.850 --> 00:16:56.770
But...

00:16:58.990 --> 00:17:01.750
I just put her in even more danger.

00:17:08.710 --> 00:17:11.250
I should have known I couldn't protect her.

00:17:12.330 --> 00:17:14.100
I'm just useless.

00:17:15.390 --> 00:17:16.840
Amata...

00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:22.060
Come out, you smelly wench!

00:17:23.140 --> 00:17:26.560
Shields failing! Aquarion's not going to last much longer!

00:17:28.210 --> 00:17:34.570
To inherit a legend is to become a legend.

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:38.570
Are you prepared to do that, Amata Sora?

00:17:42.940 --> 00:17:44.010
I'm sorry.

00:17:45.680 --> 00:17:49.790
I called us a useless pair, and said that you're like me.

00:17:50.720 --> 00:17:52.700
But you're amazing, Amata.

00:17:52.700 --> 00:17:56.760
We've only just met, but you're willing to protect me.

00:17:57.340 --> 00:18:00.140
Even though I'm weak, and all I ever do is cry.

00:18:01.090 --> 00:18:02.640
Mikono...

00:18:07.770 --> 00:18:09.170
Thank you.

00:18:09.780 --> 00:18:10.730
And I'm sorry.

00:18:14.060 --> 00:18:14.860
Thank you.

00:18:20.060 --> 00:18:21.860
Mikono's hand...

00:18:22.960 --> 00:18:24.500
It's small...

00:18:24.500 --> 00:18:26.100
Smooth...

00:18:26.100 --> 00:18:27.250
Warm...

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:30.780
And soft!

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:35.210
What the...

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:03.330
No way!

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:05.790
Aquarion is... flying!

00:19:06.390 --> 00:19:10.710
That acceleration isn't just Aquarion!

00:19:10.710 --> 00:19:13.290
They're almost into orbit!

00:19:13.290 --> 00:19:17.010
It must be that boy's Element Power!

00:19:44.060 --> 00:19:45.300
Whoa!

00:19:46.090 --> 00:19:47.450
Is it over?

00:19:52.600 --> 00:19:54.170
Damn you!

00:20:00.010 --> 00:20:01.670
A Dimension Gate!

00:20:03.680 --> 00:20:04.770
Kagura.

00:20:04.770 --> 00:20:06.810
I'm sorry, but you're out of time.

00:20:06.810 --> 00:20:08.310
Izumo! But I—

00:20:08.800 --> 00:20:11.980
"Can still fight"? This is no time for jokes.

00:20:13.470 --> 00:20:17.820
Just admit you've lost and come back already.

00:20:18.510 --> 00:20:19.260
Fine!

00:20:27.080 --> 00:20:27.920
Hey!

00:20:27.920 --> 00:20:29.190
Amata?

00:20:29.190 --> 00:20:30.620
Amata!

00:20:50.910 --> 00:20:51.880
Cayenne!

00:21:05.660 --> 00:21:06.740
Amata!

00:21:07.430 --> 00:21:10.780
You're not nearly good enough for Mikono.

00:21:10.780 --> 00:21:12.250
Cayenne. Zessica.

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:14.280
Bring those two back to headquarters.

00:21:15.070 --> 00:21:19.750
Roger on the boy, but the girl's useless to us.

00:21:20.390 --> 00:21:24.960
We can't just let someone who has been inside an Aquaria leave.

00:21:25.820 --> 00:21:26.830
Fine.

00:21:32.890 --> 00:21:35.550
I finally found...

00:21:36.900 --> 00:21:40.710
the one person who'll wait for me.

00:21:54.450 --> 00:21:57.160
Perhaps that flying boy is...

00:21:59.080 --> 00:22:00.330
No, he couldn't be.

00:22:07.770 --> 00:22:10.050
The wild child's back.

00:22:21.860 --> 00:22:22.460
Jin.

00:22:22.460 --> 00:22:24.570
What did you do to my Gnis?

00:22:25.600 --> 00:22:27.560
And how was the harvest?

00:22:29.830 --> 00:22:31.120
I found one.

00:22:36.840 --> 00:22:39.000
My very own wench.
